{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1444547-what-are-the-most-useful-knacks","id":1444547,"title":"What are the most useful Knacks?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-18T14:23:15-07:00","id":1444547,"title":"What are the most useful Knacks?","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> As the title says, what are the most useful (compared to equivalent level i.e. Immortal or Heroic) knacks during play? By useful I mean, either most bang for your buck or most frequently used, it can be for each Calling, or perhaps there are clear winners overall.<br /> <br /> And as a secondary question, regarding the <b>Omniglot Translation</b> knack, does this knack make you conversant in all languages, or does only work in languages you already know (just granting speed in the process)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 04-18-2021, 05:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-18T19:53:56-07:00","id":1444589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1444547-what-are-the-most-useful-knacks#post1444547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">regarding the <b>Omniglot Translation</b> knack, does this knack make you conversant in all languages, or does only work in languages you already know (just granting speed in the process)?</div> </div> </div> </div>To talk about particular Knack, best is quote it in discussion:<br /> <br /> <i><b>Omniglot Translation: </b>When you converse in or read a foreign language, your communication is flawless, without a trace of an accent. You can turn out translations in your native language in a matter of minutes without needing to roll. If you are translating mystical runes or the handwriting of Gods, you still do so swiftly, but must make a Knack Skill roll. </i><br /> <br /> Text implies supernatural understanding of languages as the shtick of this Knack. As such, I go with more leeway here and give <b>Omniglot</b> real <i>'I understand dead languages'</i> vibe. Especially, as compared to other Knacks in <b>Origin</b> level - not too mention those on <b>Hero</b> level - it's rather tame in comparison. And it just cool to translate dead languages or that your characters normally not know. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, remember - <b>Scion</b>, in the end, is game about gods in modern world. ( Or they servants. ) Giving them truly supernal feel is totally in the heart of this game world. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-18-2021, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T05:23:13-07:00","id":1444632,"title":"","content":"The Immortal Destroyer Knack &quot;By will alone&quot; is really powerful. The ability to use Weapontags without the need to have a weapon is after all quite handy. As the rules dont really specify the number of Tags your choosen weapons can have it is entirely possible to have a Scion with an unlimited ammo rocketlauncher that no security guard or metal detector can find.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26520-mugbearer23","name":"Mugbearer23","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T14:47:08-07:00","id":1444716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mugbearer23</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1444547-what-are-the-most-useful-knacks?p=1444632#post1444632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Immortal Destroyer Knack &amp;quot;By will alone&amp;quot; is really powerful. The ability to use Weapontags without the need to have a weapon is after all quite handy. As the rules dont really specify the number of Tags your choosen weapons can have it is entirely possible to have a Scion with an unlimited ammo rocketlauncher that no security guard or metal detector can find.</div> </div> </div> </div>Glad I'm not the only person the think of rocket launcher punches. Minigun punches are nice too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T16:18:22-07:00","id":1445368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1444547-what-are-the-most-useful-knacks?p=1444589#post1444589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To talk about particular Knack, best is quote it in discussion:<br /> <br /> <i><b>Omniglot Translation: </b>When you converse in or read a foreign language, your communication is flawless, without a trace of an accent. You can turn out translations in your native language in a matter of minutes without needing to roll. If you are translating mystical runes or the handwriting of Gods, you still do so swiftly, but must make a Knack Skill roll. </i><br /> <br /> Text implies supernatural understanding of languages as the shtick of this Knack. As such, I go with more leeway here and give <b>Omniglot</b> real <i>'I understand dead languages'</i> vibe. Especially, as compared to other Knacks in <b>Origin</b> level - not too mention those on <b>Hero</b> level - it's rather tame in comparison. And it just cool to translate dead languages or that your characters normally not know. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, remember - <b>Scion</b>, in the end, is game about gods in modern world. ( Or they servants. ) Giving them truly supernal feel is totally in the heart of this game world. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, this was my interpretation.<br /> <br /> <br /> Regarding the Wireless Interface knack:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Wireless Interface:</b> Electronic devices respond you<br /> without needing to touch them. They must be powered<br /> on and functional, but you can use a number of<br /> devices in the same Field as you equal to your Knack<br /> Skill with your hands free. If you try to do other<br /> things while communing with technology, you must<br /> make a mixed action roll. </div> </div> </div>There is nothing to say that the devices have to be yours, right? So I can open electronic doors, manipulate ATMs, etc.<br /> <br /> Seems really powerful used creatively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-23T05:49:32-07:00","id":1445466,"title":"","content":"For Wireless Interface, you'd still need to make the rolls to crack the systems. The knack just lets you interface with them, not control them at your whim. Still, being able to hack an electronic lock without touching it gives you a lot of plausible deniability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}